      <div class="split__body prose">
        <p class="rv">Security Architecture Review evaluates how an organization's IT systems are designed and how security controls work together to protect applications, networks and sensitive business data. It helps identify weaknesses in system design and security configurations that could create opportunities for unauthorized access or expose critical business resources to cyber threats.</p>
        <p class="rv">CipherTrivia's Security Architecture Review Services examine application architecture and network infrastructure along with cloud environments, identity and access controls, and data protection mechanisms. Our assessment identifies gaps in security design and evaluates how effectively existing controls address potential risks. We provide actionable findings and prioritized recommendations to help businesses improve their security architecture, make informed technology decisions and build stronger protection into their IT infrastructure.</p>
