<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s4-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s4-title">Common Architecture-Level Risk Areas We Identify</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Security weaknesses can originate from the way systems are designed and connected rather than from individual software vulnerabilities alone. CipherTrivia's Security Architecture Review Services help identify design-level risks across applications and infrastructure so businesses can address security gaps before they expose critical systems or sensitive information.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="triggers">
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("segments", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Weak Security Boundaries Between Systems</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Poorly defined boundaries between applications and infrastructure can allow unauthorized access to critical resources. We examine how systems are separated and how access is controlled to identify gaps that could expose sensitive business functions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("escalate", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Excessive Access Privileges</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Users and applications with broader permissions than necessary can increase the risk of data exposure and unauthorized changes. Our review evaluates access design and permission structures to identify opportunities to apply least-privilege access.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("api", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Insecure Application and API Communication</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Applications often exchange information through APIs and interconnected services. We assess communication paths and security controls to identify weaknesses that could expose sensitive data or allow unauthorized interactions between system components.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("cloud-alert", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Cloud Misconfigurations</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Cloud environments can introduce risks when storage resources and services are configured incorrectly or exposed beyond their intended audience. We review cloud security architecture to identify design gaps involving resource access and security boundaries.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("lateral", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Inadequate Network Segmentation</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">When critical systems share insufficiently restricted network access, a security incident affecting one system may spread to others. Our assessment evaluates network segmentation and connectivity to identify paths that could increase the impact of an attack.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("database", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Gaps in Data Protection Architecture</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Sensitive information may be exposed when systems lack appropriate data classification and protection controls. We examine how data is stored and transferred along with access restrictions and encryption practices to identify architectural weaknesses.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("pillar", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Single Points of Failure in Security Controls</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Overdependence on a single security mechanism can leave critical systems exposed if that control fails or is bypassed. We review the placement and coverage of security controls to identify areas that may require additional safeguards.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("eye-off", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Insufficient Logging and Security Visibility</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Limited visibility across applications and infrastructure can make suspicious activity harder to detect and investigate. Our review examines logging and monitoring design to identify gaps that could affect incident detection and response.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("link", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Insecure Integration Between Systems</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Connections between internal platforms and third-party services can introduce security risks when trust relationships and access permissions are not properly defined. We assess integration points to identify weaknesses that could expose connected systems or business data.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

